   "transitions hand over from the item before (held on its last frame) to the next",
   "effects on an item, on a track and on the whole clip; deterministic frame to frame",
   "every context that is read back (effects, luma masks) is made with willReadFrequently, the frame\\'s own included",
   "masks: alpha, inverted and luma; the mask moves with the layer unless it has its own transform",
   "presets: a named asset that is a base plus params; it pins the base and draws the same",
   "a preset pins the assets named in its params: a theme preset resolves, and keeps that version",
   "precomps: layers saved as one asset with exposed params; replacing them keeps the picture",
   "split_item is a continuation: the seed, the transition, the motions, the effects and the mask carry on over the cut",
   "a transition without a duration runs for its asset\\'s own, else 0.5 s, and never for longer than its item",
   "precomps: a transition between saved layers still plays, within its track; a layer without a duration lasts as long as the precomp",
   "metadata is edited without a new code version; search follows; null goes back to the source",
   "params saved as the new defaults: the source is rewritten in place, the old version is untouched",
